## Irvine, California Lemon Law and Used Cars

Unlike some states, faulty used vehicles can receive benefits under lemon law in Irvine, California.

Did You Buy a Defective Used Car from an Auto Dealership?

The used lemon can be processed like new if it was bought with a warranty or an implied warranty of merchantability.

Learn Your Used Car Lemon Law Rights

According to California lemon law, car dealerships must pay repair costs and provide a replacement/refund. The warrantor covers the legal fees.

Did You Buy the Vehicle “As Is”?

Per California law, the “as is” clause must be displayed prior to purchase. Your rights indicate you may not be eligible for benefits if you bought the vehicle “[as is](/blog/avoid-buying-a-car-as-is-from-a-dealership).”

